SectionB(4x3=12)Q. I Define window and viewport. What do you understand by viewing transformation? [1+2]9,Il lxplain the working of color cRT with shadow mask method. t3lQ. III Show that rotation about x axis followed by a rotation about y axis is not commutaiive.t3lQ. IV Rotate a triangle (0,0), (1,0), (1,1) with respect to the origin anticlockwise by an angle30o and then translate it 3 units to the left and 5 unit to down. t3lQ.V Write Bresenham's line drawing algorithm. Consider a line from (0,0) t9 (6, 6) by usingBresenham's line drawing algorithm rasterizing this line. [1.5+1.5]SectionC (4x5=20)Q. I What is the importance of hidden line and surface removal algorithm? Discuss themechanism of Z-buffer surface removal algorithm and differentiate it with A-buffer
surface removal algorithm.Q.II Write short note on JPEG? Explain the steps for JPEG encoding.
